### Application liveness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### PostgreSQL connectivity (200 when connected, 503 when unavailable)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health/db
Accept: application/json

### Version 1 OpenAPI schema (when APP_DOCS_ENABLED=true)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/openapi.json
Accept: application/json
